      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Podcast clip\n\nWrite a topic. The LLM writes a short HOST and GUEST dialogue, **Seed TTS** voices both speakers, **Seed ASR** turns the result into SRT subtitles and **Seedream** paints the cover art.\n\nChange the voices in *Host voice* and *Guest voice*. Needs ModelArk and Seed Speech keys in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
